  "ruleText": "Auc 301.02 Non-Resident Information. The non‑resident application shall have the same information as the resident application with the addition of a power-of-attorney appointing the New Hampshire Secretary of State’s office as said out of state auctioneer’s attorney for purposes of service of process in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #1993, eff 3-31-82; ss by #2706, eff 5-10-84; ss by #4093, eff 7-21-86; EXPIRED 7-21-92\n\nNew. #5441, eff 7-27-92; ss by #6658, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06\n\nNew. #12201-B, eff 6-7-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/auc100-500.html"
